        "body": "<p>We study recurring patterns in everyday life, particularly the sensory experiences, routines and environments that accompany transitions between human states.</p><p>Rather than designing products around isolated outcomes, we design rituals that participate in those transitions. Each formulation is intended to become part of a repeatable experience that gives the beginning or end of a state greater clarity.</p><p>Every formulation, article, soundscape and sensory environment begins with the same question:</p><p><strong>How can this help make a human transition more recognisable?</strong></p>"
